:55.599" end="0:56.390">din</span> <span begin="0:56.390" end="0:58.765">seninul</span> <span begin="0:58.765" end="1:00.348">cer</span></p><p begin="1:00.348" end="1:06.741" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.348" end="1:01.140">Îi</span> <span begin="1:01.140" end="1:03.515">trimite</span> <span begin="1:03.515" end="1:06.741">mesageri.</span></p><p begin="1:06.741" end="1:13.437" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.741" end="1:09.498">Îngerași</span> <span begin="1:09.498" end="1:10.286">din</span> <span begin="1:10.286" end="1:11.074">cer</span> <span begin="1:11.074" end="1:13.437">coboară,</span></p><p begin="1:13.437" end="1:19.738" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.437" end="1:15.887">Frumușel</span> <span begin="1:15.887" end="1:16.587">îl</span> <span begin="1:16.587" end="1:19.738">înconjoară</span></p><p begin="1:19.738" end="1:26.039" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.738" end="1:20.526">Și-l</span> <span begin="1:20.526" end="1:23.676">acoperă</span> <span begin="1:23.676" end="1:26.039">ușor</span></p><p begin="1:26.039" end="1:32.341" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.039" end="1:26.827">Cu</span> <span begin="1:26.827" end="1:30.765">frumoasă-aripa</span> <span begin="1:30.765" end="1:32.341">lor.</span></p></div></body></tt>